{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CfrupSBkaHAcKPhREDtwM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A constrained package now bypasses the `--max-release-age` filter, so a pin like `boto3==1.35.88` is no longer dropped by the age window. The regression tests pass, and they fail without the fix.\n\n**The fix** (`src/fromager/resolver.py`, `find_all_matching_from_provider`): if the provider's constraints pin the package, the age cutoff is skipped and an info log says so. I put it here rather than in the bootstrap caller so every path that calls this function gets the same behaviour. The docstring notes the exemption.\n\n**Regression tests** (`tests/test_cooldown.py`, added after the existing max-release-age tests):\n- `test_max_release_age_constraint_overrides_age_filter`: a pinned, too-old version is returned in multi-version mode (`fallback_on_empty_age_filter=False`), where the bug produced an empty result.\n- `test_max_release_age_constraint_no_warning_with_fallback`: the misleading \"keeping all to avoid empty resolution\" warning no longer fires for a pinned package.\n\n**Results:**\n- `tests/test_cooldown.py`: 38 passed. With only the source change reverted, the two new tests fail; with the fix restored, they pass.\n- `tests/test_resolver.py`, `test_bootstrap_requirement_resolver.py`, `test_bootstrap_requirement_resolver_multiple.py`, `test_sources.py`: 104 passed.\n- `hatch run lint:fix` on both files passed after one formatting change to the new test code.\n- `hatch run mypy:check` reports two errors at `resolver.py:1195` and `:1318`. My diff does not touch those lines, but I did not confirm they existed before my change because the `.venv` has no mypy binary.\n\nNothing is committed. Per the project guide, commits need your go-ahead."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1581,"cache_read_input_tokens":94495,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1581},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"654381bb-5696-42e8-9f4b-b8cc04a5fbf5","uuid":"e24e5f88-f9ae-4fc4-93bc-2f926535a6a3","timestamp":"2026-10-09T15:37:13.644Z","request_id":"req_011CfrupRrQFK9aLPqDgcZCh"}
